CC0 1.0 Universal

Statement of Purpose

The laws of most jurisdictions throughout the world automatically confer exclusive Copyright and Related Rights upon the creator of an original work.

CC0 enables anyone to waive their copyright interests in a work and thereby place it as completely as possible in the public domain.

To the extent possible under law, the person who associated CC0 with this work has waived all copyright and related or neighboring rights to this work.
